Steve P. Miale had an idea concerning the use of magic markers to make
blessed scrolls via scrolls of mail.  Sorry, Steve, but it won't work.

Scrolls of mail are useless.  You can't #dip them or zap them with 
cancellation to make blank scrolls, and you can't polymorph them into
other scrolls.  (This is not conjecture; it's from the code itself.)

Scrolls of mail only take up space in your inventory.  You could keep
them for the weight (not much) or wield them (you've got to be kidding)
or let nymphs steal them.  Other than that, you might as well just read
them, or leave them behind.



